{
  "dom_id": "step-4860",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Inferring the Sign of the Slope of a Graphed Line",
  "problem": "Given the following graph, what can we say about the sign of the slope?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14166993/assets/ffa6dd91f72bc66c943e88aa764a64811391a00af162b40320ce3d90f96b16a4.png)",
  "worked_solution": "Remember that slope is the amount the line rises vertically per unit that it runs horizontally.\n\nSince the graph decreases ($\\searrow$) as we go from left to right, the line rises by a negative amount.\n\nTherefore, the slope of the line is negative.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-4860\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"4860\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"990\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-4860\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-12\">Inferring the Sign of the Slope of a Graphed Line</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"4860\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <p>Given the following graph, what can we say about the sign of the slope?</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-4d17f6f8a369a6dc323efd83fdcb9178\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/4d17f6f8a369a6dc323efd83fdcb9178\"></div>\n            </div>     \n\n            <div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n\n            <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Remember that slope is the amount the line rises vertically per unit that it runs horizontally.</p>\n<p>Since the graph decreases (<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.324ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1000.5 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\searrow</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2198\" d=\"M55 675Q55 683 60 689T75 695Q77 695 83 693Q87 691 482 296Q532 246 605 174T717 62T799 -20T859 -80T878 -97Q874 -93 874 -41Q874 64 929 151Q940 168 947 168Q951 168 960 159T970 145Q970 143 956 121T928 54T913 -45Q913 -83 920 -114T936 -163T944 -185Q942 -194 934 -194Q932 -194 914 -186T864 -170T795 -162Q743 -162 698 -176T630 -205T605 -220Q601 -220 592 -211T582 -197Q582 -187 611 -170T691 -138T787 -123Q824 -123 847 -128Q848 -128 778 -57T453 268Q58 664 56 668Q55 670 55 675Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2198\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>) as we go from left to right, the line rises by a negative amount.</p>\n<p>Therefore, the slope of the line is negative.</p>\n\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
